  <title>CHDIR Command</title>
  <keywords>
    <keyword>CD command</keyword>
    <keyword>CHDIR command</keyword>
    <keyword>Commands</keyword>
    <keyword>Files and folders</keyword>
  </keywords>
  <body>
    <header>
      <para styleclass="Heading1">CHDIR | CD Command</para>
    </header>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><snippet src="__FoxProOnly" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><snippet src="__CommandInclude" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">用途</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">更改当前文件夹。</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">语法</para>
    <para styleclass="Code with box">CHDIR | CD &lt;FolderName&gt;</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">参数</para>
    <para styleclass="List">&lt;FolderName&gt;<tab />必须设为当前文件夹的文件夹名称。该名称可以是相对路径或绝对路径。名称可以带引号，也可以不带引号。</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">备注</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">CD 是 CHDIR 的同义词。如果该文件夹不存在，则会引发错误。</para>
    <para styleclass="Body Text"><snippet src="__IncludeLibVFP" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">参见</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="command_MKDIR">MKDIR</link>, <link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="command_RMDIR">RMDIR</link>, <link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="command_SET_DEFAULT">SET DEFAULT</link>, <link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="html\Overload_XSharp_Core_Functions_CurDir.htm" domain="XSharpRef.chm">CurDir()</link></para>
  </body>
